OL,3,GNEWSA'Tropical jungle' of wallabies,
OL,4,Aporcupines and parrots must move after
OL,5,Aneighbours complain
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who lives in a log cabin and
OL,8,Fkeeps wallabies, mongooses, porcupines,
OL,9,Fparrots and other rare birds has been
OL,10,Ftold to move.
OL,12,FJames Wale relocated to the rural
OL,13,FCarmarthenshire site two years ago,
OL,14,Fhaving previously run a rare bird
OL,15,Fbusiness in Pembrokeshire.
OL,17,FNeighbours said the site sounded like a
OL,18,F"tropical jungle", especially at night.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
