OL,3,GNEWSA'Tropical jungle' of wallabies,
OL,4,Aporcupines and parrots must move after
OL,5,Aneighbours complain
OL,6,
OL,7,FCarmarthenshire Council issued Wale
OL,8,Fwith an enforcement notice alleging he
OL,9,Fhad broken planning rules, but he has
OL,10,Fbeen given more time to relocate the
OL,11,Fanimals.
